#################################
### Separatist Station Models ###
#################################


#	Model					Section								Built-In Locators

#	CIS Starbase L1			-	Outpost							-	Weapons
#	CIS Starbase L2			-	Starport						-	Weapons
#	CIS Starbase L3			-	Starhold						-	Weapons
#	CIS Starbase L4			-	Star Fortress						-	Weapons
#	CIS Starbase L5			-	Citadel + Solar Stronghold + Headquarters (Station)	-	Weapons
#	Spacedock 1			-	Research Station					-	n/a
#	Spacedock 2			-	Observation Post					-	n/a
#	Spacedock 3			-	Mining Station						-	n/a
#	Spacedock 4			-	n/a							-	n/a
#	Spacedock 5			-	n/a							-	n/a
#	Golan Space Defense Gun 1	-	Military Station Small					-	Weapons + Explosions
#	Golan Space Defense Gun II	-	Military Station Medium					-	Weapons + Explosions
#	Golan Space Defense Gun III	-	Military Station Large					-	Weapons + Explosions
#	The Wheel L1			-	Habitat Phase 1 + Citadel Phase 1			-	n/a
#	The Wheel L2			-	Habitat Phase 2 + Citadel Phase 2			-	n/a
#	The Wheel L3			-	Habitat Phase 3 + Citadel Phase 3			-	n/a
#	IGBC Gun Platform		-	Headquarters (Megastructure)				-	Weapons + Explosions (& Detonate)
#	Laser Defense Satellite		-	Ion Cannon						-	Weapons
#	Hyperspace Beacon		-	Hyper Relay						-	Lights
#	Asteroid Mining Base		-	Asteroid Manufactory					-	Lights + Effects


